{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a56bfe567aec24da391224dc2f10e8cc4ef626dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/8/398f4866b6ff8da22f85f5479ebaff2375850f1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+i)^{20}-(1-i)^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb0e9d95d24bc9cc3e9c178792e028e15187098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } -1024 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }-1024i \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 1024 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }1024i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"510\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/255eb5c3e5100e2ec247d0ca201770bfeb664dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+i)^2=2i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e40d4f2908a590a3027bb2c50e95f039daa55f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-i)^2=-2i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b4614dacf145619557236b885e0e759c1d61a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+i)^{20}-(1-i)^{20}=(2i)^{10}-(-2i)^{10}=(2i)^{10}-(2i)^{10}=0, \\boxed{\\text{C}}.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Pro